# Single-page app fallback.
#
# Without this, opening or refreshing a deep link like /customers/<id> asks
# Cloudflare for a file that does not exist and returns 404. Serving index.html
# with a 200 lets React Router handle the path.
#
# Pages Functions are matched BEFORE static assets and redirects, so
# /calendar/<token>.ics still reaches functions/calendar/[token].ts.
